---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Brand from '../components/Brand.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/ContactBand.astro';
import Video from '../components/Video.astro';
const uses=[
 {n:'01',title:'Zone picking',body:'Your people pick. Robots travel between zones, collecting items for separate orders before heading to packing.',items:['Plan zones around locations and pick density.','Guide picks with SKU, quantity, location, and barcode confirmation.','Keep orders in separate bins, with client separation rules.']},
 {n:'02',title:'Order transport',body:'Move completed picks between stations without pulling associates away from their work area.',items:['Define pickup, packing, and return locations.','Choose shelves and totes for your order mix.','Set clear loading, unloading, and exception handoffs.']},
 {n:'03',title:'Material movement',body:'Put repeat trips between workstations on a robot’s task list. Start with a route that has a clear purpose.',items:['Move materials between defined workstations.','Assess replenishment and return transport.','Match the carrying configuration to the load.']}
];
const specs=[['Maximum payload','300 kg / 661 lb'],['Base dimensions (L × W × H)','835 × 500 × 1,350 mm'],['Maximum travel speed','1.2 m/s'],['Runtime at full load','8 hours'],['Runtime without load','12 hours'],['Charge time, 0–90%','2 hours'],['Navigation','VSLAM + LiDAR SLAM']];
---
<Base title="Robots" description="What packsel robots do in a 3PL warehouse (zone picking, order transport, material movement) and the hardware and specifications behind them.">
<div class="interior">
<section class="page-hero"><p class="page-eyebrow">Robots for 3PL warehouses.</p><h1>Move the work.<br />Keep people picking.</h1><p class="page-deck"><Brand tm /> leases mobile robots for the trips and handoffs<br />that fill your warehouse day.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Let’s talk</a><a class="page-link" href="/warehouse-demo/">Watch them in the demo</a></div><nav class="jump-links" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#uses">What they do</a><a href="#hardware">The hardware</a><a href="#specs">Specifications</a></nav></section>
<div class="content-wrap"><figure class="media-frame" data-reveal><img src="/images/warehouse-robots.webp" srcset="/images/warehouse-robots-800.webp 800w, /images/warehouse-robots.webp 1440w" sizes="(max-width:1264px) calc(100vw - 64px), 1200px" width="1440" height="960" alt="Shelf-equipped packsel robots transporting cartons and totes through a warehouse aisle" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>Product visualization. Final configurations and workflows are defined with your team.</figcaption></figure></div>

<section id="uses" class="page-section content-wrap"><div class="section-intro" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">What they do.</p><h2>Three ways to<br />take travel off the task list.</h2></div><div class="feature-grid">{uses.map(s=><article class="feature-card hover-surface" data-reveal><span class="card-number">{s.n}</span><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.body}</p><ul class="simple-list">{s.items.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div></section>

<section id="hardware" class="neutral-band page-section"><div class="content-wrap split-feature"><figure class="product-surface" data-reveal><img src="/images/transport-robot.webp" width="800" height="1200" alt="packsel platform robot with a compact mobile base, mast, and touchscreen" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Product visualization · Platform configuration</figcaption></figure><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">The hardware: platform.</p><h2>A compact base.<br />A useful daily role.</h2><p>A loading platform and an onboard touchscreen for point-to-point material transport.</p><div class="spec-strip"><div><strong>300 kg</strong><span>Maximum payload</span></div><div><strong>1.2 m/s</strong><span>Maximum speed</span></div><div><strong>8 h</strong><span>Full-load runtime*</span></div></div><p class="note">*Runtime varies with load, route, and operating conditions. <a href="#specs">Full specifications</a></p></div></div></section>

<section class="content-wrap page-section"><div class="section-intro" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">The hardware: shelves.</p><h2>More on board.<br />Less back and forth.</h2><p>Multi-level shelves keep products and totes organized between workstations. A picking configuration pairs separate order bins with a scan-guided workflow.</p></div><figure class="media-frame" data-reveal><img src="/images/factory-shelf-robot.webp" srcset="/images/factory-shelf-robot-800.webp 800w, /images/factory-shelf-robot.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width:1264px) calc(100vw - 64px), 1200px" width="1600" height="900" alt="packsel shelf robot carrying cartons and totes on a factory floor" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Illustrative shelf configuration. Final hardware may differ.</figcaption></figure><div class="page-actions"><a class="page-link" href="/warehouse-demo/">Try zone picking in the demo</a></div></section>

<section id="specs" class="neutral-band page-section"><div class="content-wrap split-feature"><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">Specifications.</p><h2>Know the platform.</h2><p>Reference specifications for standard transport. Payload dimensions and accessories affect the clearance your floor needs.</p><a class="page-link" href="/how-it-works/">How we size a fleet for your floor</a></div><div class="spec-panel" data-reveal><table class="spec-table"><caption class="visually-hidden">Standard transport platform reference specifications</caption><tbody>{specs.map(([label,value])=><tr><th scope="row">{label}</th><td>{value}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table><p class="note">Reference: supplied product specification, December 2025. Ratings are not a site-specific performance guarantee. Final specifications are confirmed in your proposal.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="content-wrap page-section split-feature"><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><p class="page-eyebrow">See it move.</p><h2>Made for<br />the daily trip.</h2><p>Watch the platform navigate and carry materials between work areas.</p></div><div data-reveal><Video /></div></section>
<ContactBand />
</div>
</Base>

<style>
  .jump-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-5); margin-top: var(--space-6); font-size: var(--text-sm); }
  .jump-links a { color: var(--color-ink-secondary); padding: var(--space-2) 0; }
  .jump-links a:hover { color: var(--color-ink); }
  [id] { scroll-margin-top: var(--space-7); }
</style>
